    "title": "Hanf stars in Northern Burlington's win over West Deptford - Girls soccer recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Cosentino ,\n1 hours ago Gianna Hanf scored all three goals for her fourth hat trick of the season as Northern Burlington defeated West Deptford 3-1 in Columbus. Rebecca Kearns and Mia Jones had assists as the Greyhounds (8-2) won their fourth straight game. Maddie Eastlack scored the lone goal for the Eagles (4-4-1). If... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
